@startuml SD04_Tenant_UploadMonthlySales
hide footbox
title SD04 Tenant Upload Monthly Sales

actor TenantUser as TenantActor
participant App as ShopRentalApplication
participant Tenant
participant Service as ShopRentalService
participant Record as SalesRecord
participant Strategy as ProgressiveCommissionStrategy
participant Contract as LeaseContract
participant Payment
participant Bus as RentalEventBus
participant Audit as AuditLogListener

TenantActor -> App: choose Upload monthly sales record
App -> App: validate active contract + owner + ACTIVE status
App -> Tenant: uploadMonthlyRecord(contract, month, sales, strategy, service)
Tenant -> Service: submitMonthlySales(contract, month, sales, strategy)
Service -> Record: new(recordId, month, sales)
Service -> Record: calculateCommission(strategy, contract.commissionRate)
Record -> Strategy: calculateCommission(totalSales, baseRate)
Strategy --> Record: commissionAmount
Service -> Contract: calculateTotalRent(commissionAmount)
Contract --> Service: totalRent
Service -> Bus: publish(MONTHLY_RECORD_UPLOADED)
Bus -> Audit: onEvent(...)
Service -> Payment: new(paymentId, totalRent)
Service --> Tenant: payment
Tenant --> App: payment
App -> App: payments.add(payment)\nactivePaymentId=paymentId\nsaveStateQuietly()
App --> TenantActor: Monthly record uploaded
@enduml
